{
  "id": "deno",
  "name": "Deno",
  "description": "Deno 的研发配置、工具与依赖读取候选。",
  "verification": {
    "level": "documentation",
    "toolVersions": [
      "Deno current"
    ],
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-03"
  },
  "notes": [
    "官方脚本安装的程序位置；其他 package manager 安装位置由对应工具决定。",
    "DENO_INSTALL/DENO_DIR 不在当前变量语法中，覆盖位置需手工补；私有模块、Deno 自身权限、依赖下载与缓存写入另行处理。",
    "工具安装根及运行缓存只读；这些目录可能包含私有数据，不承诺只读访问足以完成安装或构建。"
  ],
  "platforms": {
    "darwin": {
      "readable": [
        {
          "id": "binary",
          "path": "~/.deno/bin",
          "targetType": "directory",
          "description": "Deno：已安装程序与工具链读取。",
          "containsCredentials": false,
          "sources": [
            "https://docs.deno.com/runtime/getting_started/installation/"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cache",
          "path": "~/Library/Caches/deno",
          "targetType": "directory",
          "description": "Deno：依赖或构建缓存读取，可能包含私有包和用户数据。",
          "containsCredentials": true,
          "sources": [
            "https://docs.deno.com/runtime/getting_started/installation/"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "runtime-root-1",
          "path": "~/.deno",
          "targetType": "directory",
          "description": "Deno：工具安装、运行数据及缓存的递归读取；可能包含私有包或认证配置，安装前核对范围。",
          "containsCredentials": true,
          "sources": [
            "https://docs.deno.com/runtime/getting_started/installation/"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "linux": {
      "readable": [
        {
          "id": "binary",
          "path": "~/.deno/bin",
          "targetType": "directory",
          "description": "Deno：已安装程序与工具链读取。",
          "containsCredentials": false,
          "sources": [
            "https://docs.deno.com/runtime/getting_started/installation/"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cache",
          "path": "~/.cache/deno",
          "targetType": "directory",
          "description": "Deno：依赖或构建缓存读取，可能包含私有包和用户数据。",
          "containsCredentials": true,
          "sources": [
            "https://docs.deno.com/runtime/getting_started/installation/"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "runtime-root-1",
          "path": "~/.deno",
          "targetType": "directory",
          "description": "Deno：工具安装、运行数据及缓存的递归读取；可能包含私有包或认证配置，安装前核对范围。",
          "containsCredentials": true,
          "sources": [
            "https://docs.deno.com/runtime/getting_started/installation/"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "win32": {
      "readable": [
        {
          "id": "binary",
          "path": "~/.deno/bin",
          "targetType": "directory",
          "description": "Deno：已安装程序与工具链读取。",
          "containsCredentials": false,
          "sources": [
            "https://docs.deno.com/runtime/getting_started/installation/"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cache",
          "path": "${LOCALAPPDATA}/deno",
          "targetType": "directory",
          "description": "Deno：依赖或构建缓存读取，可能包含私有包和用户数据。",
          "containsCredentials": true,
          "sources": [
            "https://docs.deno.com/runtime/getting_started/installation/"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
